      },
      "message": "feat(gate): plan one step for each test binary in quick, batch and release\n\nThe debug suites use the planner pattern of the heavy lanes (#1714): one\nbuild step, then one step for each lib, bins, binary and doc target. Each\nstep has its own log, time and pass or fail line, and --only / --failed\nselect one binary. Slow binaries stay out of batch as before.\n\nFixes #1941\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
